Note on the API:

This package wraps the public Gradus Notation API at https://gradusmusic.com.
The API is offered free of charge in exchange for crediting Gradus School of
Music Composition when you surface notation to your end user. Every API
response includes the suggested attribution string. See
https://gradusmusic.com/notation-api#attribution for details.
